{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017fF4ZMZHTn95UE5enpSew4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心framing从\"cross-benchmark variance gradient\"转向\"方差归因本身不可靠——variance\n2\t  decomposition is a measurement, not a fact\"。\n3\t\n4\t  exp-001b的item重采样不稳定性（CV=33%）成为paper centerpiece。三个Claims全部reframe：\n5\t\n6\t  Claim 1 → \"item dominance估计是sample-unstable的（CV>30%），单次方差分解——包括所有prior work——过度承诺归因确定性\"\n7\t\n8\t  Claim 2 → \"model×item交互（33%）是最大的被忽视项；treating model as fixed系统性误归因方差到item_id；separability在binary\n9\t  scoring下也不完全成立\"\n10\t\n11\t  Claim 3 → \"reproducibility budgets必须包含对budget本身的uncertainty quantification——当前D-study\n12\t  projections跨benchmark收敛（range仅60 items），消灭benchmark-specific budgets贡献，但CI宽度(±190\n13\t  items)说明budget本身需要error bars\"\n14\t\n15\t  Cross-benchmark gradient不成立（spread仅9pp，方向不符合knowledge→reasoning递减预测——GSM8K item_id=42%反而高于MMLU=38%）。\n16\t\n17\t  新hook：\"We set out to build reproducibility budgets for LLM evaluation and discovered\n18\t  that the budget itself is unreliable.\"\n19\t\n20\t  Timeline滑到ACL ARR October以容纳reframing和额外resampling实验。\n21\t\n22\t  '\n23\timagined_experiments:\n24\t- name: Full-scale precision study (confound-fixed, model-as-fixed)\n25\t  plan_id: exp-001\n26\t  description: 4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4\n27\t    orderings × 200 MMLU items, V0 enforce_eager。Model-as-fixed分析产出point estimates；后续exp-004的model-as-facet\n28\t    reanalysis将彻底改变解读。\n29\t  expected_results:\n30\t    total_records: 172800\n31\t    total_conditions: 1296\n32\t    item_variance_share_pooled: 0.378\n33\t    item_variance_share_qwen3_8b: 0.422\n34\t    item_variance_share_llama31_8b: 0.358\n35\t    item_variance_share_gemma2_9b: 0.401\n36\t    item_variance_share_mistral_7b: 0.303\n37\t    residual_share_pooled: 0.202\n38\t    precision_main_effect: 0.016\n39\t    precision_item_interaction: 0.045\n40\t    prompt_item_interaction: 0.052\n41\t    temperature_item_interaction: 0.058\n42\t    seed_item_interaction: 0.016\n43\t    ordering_item_interaction: 0.012\n44\t    prompt_main_effect: 0.007\n45\t    temperature_main_effect: 0.01\n46\t    seed_main_effect: 0.003\n47\t    ordering_main_effect: 0.002\n48\t    precision_temperature_binary: 0.015\n49\t    infra_x_method_binary_mmlu: 0.015\n50\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.668\n51\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.672\n52\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.67\n53\t    g_coefficient_correct: 0.32\n54\t    cross_model_item_variance_cv: 0.13\n55\t  result_rationale: 'Confound修复后precision主效应从MVP的夸大水平降至1.6%，三种精度accuracy收敛到66.8-67.2%。Item_id在model-as-fixed分析中仍为最大成分（37.8%\n56\t    pooled），表面上支持Claim 1。但四个模型间item_id的变异（30.3-42.2%，CV=13%）已暗示model×item交互的重要性——Mistral-7B仅30.3%（sliding\n57\t    window attention+不同tokenizer覆盖率改变item-model关系），Qwen3-8B最高42.2%。\n58\t\n59\t    G=0.32反映binary scoring下低reliability：200 items不足以压制item×facet交互。\n60\t\n61\t    关键陷阱：这些point estimates看起来支持item dominance narrative，但exp-001b将显示它们对item selection高度敏感（CV=33%），exp-004将显示model-as-fixed分析系统性膨胀item_id（38%→15%）。此阶段的所有table都是\"misleading\n62\t    precision\"的例证。\n63\t\n64\t    infra×method binary在MMLU上1.5%——高于MVP的<0.5%但尚未breaks separability。200 items（vs\n65\t    MVP的50）包含更多borderline items，precision差异在这些items上翻转binary outcome。\n66\t\n67\t    '\n68\t  tables:\n69\t  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Components (model-as-fixed pooled, MMLU binary)'\n70\t    columns:\n71\t    - Component\n72\t    - Qwen3-8B\n73\t    - Llama-3.1-8B\n74\t    - Gemma-2-9B\n75\t    - Mistral-7B\n76\t    - Pooled\n77\t    rows:\n78\t    - - item_id\n79\t      - 42.2%\n80\t      - 35.8%\n81\t      - 40.1%\n82\t      - 30.3%\n83\t      - 37.8%\n84\t    - - residual\n85\t      - 17.4%\n86\t      - 21.2%\n87\t      - 18.8%\n88\t      - 26.1%\n89\t      - 20.2%\n90\t    - - temperature:item\n91\t      - 6.3%\n92\t      - 5.9%\n93\t      - 5.2%\n94\t      - 5.8%\n95\t      - 5.8%\n96\t    - - prompt:item\n97\t      - 5.8%\n98\t      - 5.4%\n99\t      - 4.8%\n100\t      - 4.2%\n101\t      - 5.2%\n102\t    - - precision:item\n103\t      - 4.9%\n104\t      - 4.6%\n105\t      - 4.2%\n106\t      - 3.8%\n107\t      - 4.5%\n108\t    - - seed:item\n109\t      - 1.8%\n110\t      - 1.7%\n111\t      - 1.4%\n112\t      - 1.3%\n113\t      - 1.6%\n114\t    - - ordering:item\n115\t      - 1.4%\n116\t      - 1.2%\n117\t      - 1.1%\n118\t      - 0.9%\n119\t      - 1.2%\n120\t    - - precision\n121\t      - 1.8%\n122\t      - 1.7%\n123\t      - 1.5%\n124\t      - 1.3%\n125\t      - 1.6%\n126\t    - - temperature\n127\t      - 1.2%\n128\t      - 1.0%\n129\t      - 0.9%\n130\t      - 0.8%\n131\t      - 1.0%\n132\t    - - prompt\n133\t      - 0.8%\n134\t      - 0.7%\n135\t      - 0.6%\n136\t      - 0.5%\n137\t      - 0.7%\n138\t    - - precision:temperature\n139\t      - 1.6%\n140\t      - 1.5%\n141\t      - 1.4%\n142\t      - 1.2%\n143\t      - 1.5%\n144\t    - - all other\n145\t      - 14.8%\n146\t      - 19.3%\n147\t      - 20.0%\n148\t      - 23.8%\n149\t      - 18.9%\n150\t  - name: 'Table 2: Accuracy by Precision (post-confound-fix)'\n151\t    columns:\n152\t    - Model\n153\t    - FP32\n154\t    - BF16\n155\t    - FP16\n156\t    - Max Δ\n157\t    rows:\n158\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n159\t      - '0.680'\n160\t      - '0.684'\n161\t      - '0.682'\n162\t      - '0.004'\n163\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n164\t      - '0.660'\n165\t      - '0.664'\n166\t      - '0.662'\n167\t      - '0.004'\n168\t    - - Gemma-2-9B\n169\t      - '0.706'\n170\t      - '0.710'\n171\t      - '0.708'\n172\t      - '0.004'\n173\t    - - Mistral-7B\n174\t      - '0.622'\n175\t      - '0.626'\n176\t      - '0.624'\n177\t      - '0.004'\n178\t  figures_description:\n179\t  - 'Stacked bar: MVP(confounded) vs exp-001(fixed) 方差分解对比。item_id从58.4%降至37.8%、precision从~7%降至1.6%，标注confound\n180\t    correction的影响量。'\n181\t  - '4-panel heatmap: 每个model的200 items × conditions accuracy SD，展示item difficulty的model-conditional\n182\t    pattern——Mistral-7B的高-SD items集合与其他三个模型的overlap仅~60%。'\n183\t  analysis: '表面支持item dominance（38% pooled），但这是一个unstable point estimate。Cross-model\n184\t    CV=13%暗示model×item问题。exp-001b和exp-004将分别从resampling stability和model-as-facet两个角度瓦解这个数字。Precision×temperature=1.5%开始动摇separability\n185\t    claim但尚未decisive。\n186\t\n187\t    '\n188\t- name: Item resampling stability test (paper centerpiece)\n189\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n190\t  description: 3组独立stratified MMLU 200-item samples（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama-3.1-8B\n191\t    × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample。测试item\n192\t    dominance的抽样稳定性。\n193\t  expected_results:\n194\t    item_variance_sample_seed0: 0.48\n195\t    item_variance_sample_seed7: 0.25\n196\t    item_variance_sample_seed99: 0.41\n197\t    item_variance_mean: 0.38\n198\t    item_variance_sd: 0.12\n199\t    item_resample_cv: 0.33\n200\t    residual_sample_seed0: 0.16\n201\t    residual_sample_seed7: 0.3\n202\t    residual_sample_seed99: 0.19\n203\t    g_coefficient_sample_seed0: 0.28\n204\t    g_coefficient_sample_seed7: 0.38\n205\t    g_coefficient_sample_seed99: 0.31\n206\t    g_coefficient_cv: 0.16\n207\t    variance_component_rank_order_stable: false\n208\t    rank_inversions_across_samples: 3\n209\t    bootstrap_ci_item_id_width: 0.21\n210\t    bootstrap_ci_item_id_lower: 0.27\n211\t    bootstrap_ci_item_id_upper: 0.48\n212\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n213\t    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n214\t  result_rationale: '三组不同的200-item stratified samples产出质性不同的方差分解。CV=33%意味着item dominance\n215\t    point estimate在25-48%间波动。\n216\t\n217\t    Sample seed 7抽到更多中等难度items（difficulty集中在0.4-0.6），这些items的model responses跨conditions更一致，item_id仅25%；sample\n218\t    seed 0抽到更多极难和极易items（bimodal difficulty），这些items天然有高item-level variance，推高item_id至48%。MMLU的57个subjects有非常不同的difficulty\n219\t    distributions——STEM subjects（abstract algebra, college physics）bimodal，humanities\n220\t    subjects更uniform。200-item stratified sampling在subject层面balanced，但subject内部的item\n221\t    selection对方差结构有质性影响。\n222\t\n223\t    更具破坏性的是：方差component的RANK ORDER在三组samples间不稳定。Sample 7中residual（30%）超过item_id（25%）成为最大成分，产生3次rank\n224\t    inversion。\"Item selection is the largest variance source\"取决于碰巧抽到了哪些items——不是stable\n225\t    empirical finding，而是sample-dependent measurement。\n226\t\n227\t    Bootstrap CI=[0.27, 0.48]，width=0.21——足够宽以至于无法区分\"item dominance\"（>40%）和\"item is\n228\t    one of several comparable sources\"（~25%）。\n229\t\n230\t    '\n231\t  tables:\n232\t  - name: 'Table 3: Variance Decomposition Across Item Samples (Llama-3.1-8B, MMLU)'\n233\t    columns:\n234\t    - Component\n235\t    - Sample 0\n236\t    - Sample 7\n237\t    - Sample 99\n238\t    - Mean\n239\t    - SD\n240\t    - CV\n241\t    rows:\n242\t    - - item_id\n243\t      - 48.0%\n244\t      - 25.0%\n245\t      - 41.0%\n246\t      - 38.0%\n247\t      - 12.0%\n248\t      - '0.33'\n249\t    - - residual\n250\t      - 16.0%\n251\t      - 30.0%\n252\t      - 19.0%\n253\t      - 21.7%\n254\t      - 7.5%\n255\t      - '0.35'\n256\t    - - temperature:item\n257\t      - 7.2%\n258\t      - 9.8%\n259\t      - 8.1%\n260\t      - 8.4%\n261\t      - 1.3%\n262\t      - '0.16'\n263\t    - - prompt:item\n264\t      - 5.6%\n265\t      - 8.2%\n266\t      - 6.4%\n267\t      - 6.7%\n268\t      - 1.3%\n269\t      - '0.20'\n270\t    - - precision:item\n271\t      - 4.8%\n272\t      - 6.4%\n273\t      - 5.2%\n274\t      - 5.5%\n275\t      - 0.8%\n276\t      - '0.15'\n277\t    - - temperature\n278\t      - 1.0%\n279\t      - 2.4%\n280\t      - 1.4%\n281\t      - 1.6%\n282\t      - 0.7%\n283\t      - '0.46'\n284\t    - - prompt\n285\t      - 0.6%\n286\t      - 1.8%\n287\t      - 0.9%\n288\t      - 1.1%\n289\t      - 0.6%\n290\t      - '0.58'\n291\t    - - all other\n292\t      - 16.8%\n293\t      - 16.4%\n294\t      - 18.0%\n295\t      - 17.1%\n296\t      - 0.8%\n297\t      - '0.05'\n298\t  - name: 'Table 4: G-coefficient and Rank Stability Across Item Samples'\n299\t    columns:\n300\t    - Metric\n301\t    - Sample 0\n302\t    - Sample 7\n303\t    - Sample 99\n304\t    rows:\n305\t    - - G (correct)\n306\t      - '0.28'\n307\t      - '0.38'\n308\t      - '0.31'\n309\t    - - Largest component\n310\t      - item_id\n311\t      - residual\n312\t      - item_id\n313\t    - - 2nd largest\n314\t      - residual\n315\t      - item_id\n316\t      - residual\n317\t    - - 3rd largest\n318\t      - temp:item\n319\t      - temp:item\n320\t      - temp:item\n321\t    - - Item difficulty SD\n322\t      - '0.31'\n323\t      - '0.22'\n324\t      - '0.27'\n325\t    - - Bimodality index\n326\t      - '0.71'\n327\t      - '0.38'\n328\t      - '0.58'\n329\t  figures_description:\n330\t  - 三组samples的stacked bar并排对比——'同一benchmark、同一model、不同items → 质性不同的方差结构'。Paper signature\n331\t    figure。\n332\t  - Item difficulty distribution histograms (3-panel)，展示stratified sampling的subject内item\n333\t    selection如何产生不同difficulty profiles，作为mechanistic explanation。\n334\t  - Bootstrap distribution density plot of item_id variance share，标注三组point estimates和CI\n335\t    [0.27, 0.48]，展示CI覆盖'item dominance'到'item is secondary'的entire range。\n336\t  analysis: 'Worst档paper的核心发现。Prior work（Mesting 2026、Brittlebench 2026、Bouthillier\n337\t    et al. 2021）都报告单次方差分解的point estimates作为\"findings\"，但从未测试resampling stability。CV=33%说明：如果Mesting用不同的200个items，她的43.8%\n338\t    judge dominance数字可能变成30%或55%。\n339\t\n340\t    新narrative：\"方差分解不是fact而是measurement——和所有measurement一样有自己的measurement error。当前文献忽略了这个error，导致过度自信的归因声明。\"\n341\t\n342\t    '\n343\t- name: Multi-benchmark replication (no systematic gradient)\n344\t  plan_id: exp-002\n345\t  description: 4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4\n346\t    orderings on GSM8K/ARC-Challenge/HellaSwag各200 items。\n347\t  expected_results:\n348\t    item_variance_gsm8k: 0.42\n349\t    item_variance_arc: 0.36\n350\t    item_variance_hellaswag: 0.33\n351\t    item_variance_mmlu_ref: 0.378\n352\t    cross_benchmark_gradient_spread_pp: 9\n353\t    gradient_direction: non-monotonic\n354\t    gradient_follows_prediction: false\n355\t    residual_gsm8k: 0.22\n356\t    residual_arc: 0.2\n357\t    residual_hellaswag: 0.18\n358\t    temperature_item_gsm8k: 0.08\n359\t    temperature_item_arc: 0.06\n360\t    temperature_item_hellaswag: 0.07\n361\t    seed_item_gsm8k: 0.06\n362\t    seed_item_arc: 0.04\n363\t    seed_item_hellaswag: 0.05\n364\t    prompt_item_gsm8k: 0.05\n365\t    prompt_item_arc: 0.07\n366\t    prompt_item_hellaswag: 0.04\n367\t    infra_x_method_binary_gsm8k: 0.045\n368\t    infra_x_method_binary_arc: 0.02\n369\t    infra_x_method_binary_hellaswag: 0.035\n370\t    g_coefficient_gsm8k: 0.3\n371\t    g_coefficient_arc: 0.35\n372\t    g_coefficient_hellaswag: 0.36\n373\t    benchmarks_with_item_as_largest: 3\n374\t    total_records_per_benchmark: 76800\n375\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient不成立。GSM8K的item dominance（42%）反而高于MMLU（37.8%），颠覆\"knowledge→reasoning\n376\t    item dominance递减\"预测。原因：GSM8K的200-item sample中difficulty variance极大——从简单单步算术（accuracy>95%）到复杂多步word\n377\t    problems（accuracy<15%），这个bimodal difficulty distribution推高item_id。在8B-class models上，大量GSM8K\n378\t    items要么trivially easy要么完全超出能力，ceiling/floor效应增加item-level variance。\n379\t\n380\t    HellaSwag item dominance最低（33%），不是因为\"reasoning\"（它是commonsense completion），而是其items的difficulty\n381\t    distribution更uniform（大多数items对8B models难度中等），减少了item-level variance。\n382\t\n383\t    Spread=42%-33%=9pp，在[0,12]内。关键：ordering为GSM8K>MMLU>ARC>HellaSwag，不符合任何simple knowledge-reasoning\n384\t    axis。叠加exp-001b的resampling instability（CV>30%），9pp spread完全在noise range内。\n385\t\n386\t    Separability在binary scoring下breaks on GSM8K（infra×method=4.5%）和HellaSwag（3.5%）。GSM8K因precision差异影响CoT中numerical\n387\t    computation；HellaSwag因completion scoring对token-level probability的precision敏感。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t  tables:\n391\t  - name: 'Table 5: Item Dominance Across Benchmarks (model-as-fixed)'\n392\t    columns:\n393\t    - Benchmark\n394\t    - item_id\n395\t    - residual\n396\t    - temp:item\n397\t    - prompt:item\n398\t    - seed:item\n399\t    - G\n400\t    rows:\n401\t    - - MMLU\n402\t      - 37.8%\n403\t      - 20.2%\n404\t      - 5.8%\n405\t      - 5.2%\n406\t      - 1.6%\n407\t      - '0.32'\n408\t    - - GSM8K\n409\t      - 42.0%\n410\t      - 22.0%\n411\t      - 8.0%\n412\t      - 5.0%\n413\t      - 6.0%\n414\t      - '0.30'\n415\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n416\t      - 36.0%\n417\t      - 20.0%\n418\t      - 6.0%\n419\t      - 7.0%\n420\t      - 4.0%\n421\t      - '0.35'\n422\t    - - HellaSwag\n423\t      - 33.0%\n424\t      - 18.0%\n425\t      - 7.0%\n426\t      - 4.0%\n427\t      - 5.0%\n428\t      - '0.36'\n429\t    - - Spread\n430\t      - 9pp\n431\t      - 4pp\n432\t      - 2pp\n433\t      - 3pp\n434\t      - 4pp\n435\t      - —\n436\t  - name: 'Table 6: Separability Test (binary scoring)'\n437\t    columns:\n438\t    - Benchmark\n439\t    - precision×prompt\n440\t    - precision×seed\n441\t    - precision×temp\n442\t    - Total infra×method\n443\t    rows:\n444\t    - - MMLU\n445\t      - 0.3%\n446\t      - 0.2%\n447\t      - 1.0%\n448\t      - 1.5%\n449\t    - - GSM8K\n450\t      - 1.2%\n451\t      - 1.5%\n452\t      - 1.8%\n453\t      - 4.5%\n454\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n455\t      - 0.4%\n456\t      - 0.3%\n457\t      - 1.3%\n458\t      - 2.0%\n459\t    - - HellaSwag\n460\t      - 0.8%\n461\t      - 1.0%\n462\t      - 1.7%\n463\t      - 3.5%\n464\t  - name: 'Table 7: Gradient Prediction vs Observation'\n465\t    columns:\n466\t    - Predicted\n467\t    - Observed\n468\t    - Match\n469\t    rows:\n470\t    - - MMLU > ARC > GSM8K (knowledge→reasoning递减)\n471\t      - GSM8K > MMLU > ARC > HellaSwag\n472\t      - 'No'\n473\t    - - Monotonic decrease with reasoning load\n474\t      - Non-monotonic\n475\t      - 'No'\n476\t    - - Spread > 15pp for meaningful gradient\n477\t      - Spread = 9pp\n478\t      - 'No'\n479\t  figures_description:\n480\t  - 4-benchmark stacked bar chart，颜色编码一致。GSM8K的item_id bar反而最高，标注predicted gradient\n481\t    direction (箭头) vs actual ordering。\n482\t  - 'Scatter: reasoning load (ordinal) vs item_id variance share。Points不follow预测的negative\n483\t    slope，加exp-001b extrapolation的error bars after which all benchmarks overlap。'\n484\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark gradient是original framing的primary contribution，在worst档下完全不成立：(1)\n485\t    direction错误（GSM8K>MMLU），(2) spread太小（9pp），(3) 叠加resampling instability后spread在noise\n486\t    range内。\n487\t\n488\t    但separability breaking提供新material：binary scoring下infra×method不是universally negligible的。\n489\t\n490\t    Reframe：从\"gradient exists\"变为\"gradient doesn''t exist, and that''s the finding\"——variance\n491\t    structure的benchmark variation不follow任何simple predictive axis，variance attribution\n492\t    depends on item difficulty distribution shape而非task taxonomy。\n493\t\n494\t    '\n495\t- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n496\t  plan_id: exp-003\n497\t  description: 4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n498\t    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。Hardware×methodology interaction核心测试。\n499\t  expected_results:\n500\t    hardware_main_effect: 0.05\n501\t    hardware_item_interaction: 0.06\n502\t    hardware_precision_interaction: 0.035\n503\t    hardware_methodology_interaction: 0.04\n504\t    hardware_seed_interaction: 0.02\n505\t    hardware_temperature_interaction: 0.015\n506\t    total_hardware_related_variance: 0.14\n507\t    infra_x_method_binary_with_hardware: 0.055\n508\t    separability_holds: false\n509\t    accuracy_gpu1_bf16: 0.672\n510\t    accuracy_gpu2_bf16: 0.668\n511\t    accuracy_delta_cross_hardware: 0.004\n512\t    item_id_with_hardware_facet: 0.33\n513\t    g_coefficient_with_hardware: 0.28\n514\t    total_records: 230400\n515\t  result_rationale: '两种GPU架构在BF16/FP16下产出不同accuracy（Δ=0.4pp），因为不同GPU的tensor core实现、CUDA\n516\t    kernel调度、floating-point rounding behavior不同。Hardware main=5%通过hardware×item（6%）放大：某些items在两块GPU上的correct/incorrect判定不同，这些items的logit\n517\t    margin接近decision boundary，GPU-specific numerical noise翻转outcome。\n518\t\n519\t    Hardware×methodology=4%直接breaks Claim 2：methodology因子的效应是hardware-conditional的——同一prompt在GPU1上增加accuracy\n520\t    2pp，在GPU2上可能降低1pp。Infrastructure和methodology不可分离。\n521\t\n522\t    Hardware×precision=3.5%说明precision choice的影响也是GPU-dependent的——BF16在GPU1上比FP16好，GPU2上可能相反。\n523\t\n524\t    Total hardware-related variance=14%，大于precision-related（~6%），说明hardware是比precision更重要但被忽视的方差来源。Item_id从exp-001的37.8%降至33%——single-GPU\n525\t    design系统性高估item dominance，hardware×item被misattributed to item_id。\n526\t\n527\t    '\n528\t  tables:\n529\t  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware-Related Variance Components (MMLU binary)'\n530\t    columns:\n531\t    - Component\n532\t    - Variance Share\n533\t    - 95% Bootstrap CI\n534\t    rows:\n535\t    - - hardware (main)\n536\t      - 5.0%\n537\t      - '[3.2%, 7.1%]'\n538\t    - - hardware:item\n539\t      - 6.0%\n540\t      - '[4.1%, 8.3%]'\n541\t    - - hardware:precision\n542\t      - 3.5%\n543\t      - '[2.0%, 5.2%]'\n544\t    - - hardware:prompt\n545\t      - 1.5%\n546\t      - '[0.8%, 2.4%]'\n547\t    - - hardware:seed\n548\t      - 2.0%\n549\t      - '[1.2%, 3.1%]'\n550\t    - - hardware:temperature\n551\t      - 1.5%\n552\t      - '[0.7%, 2.5%]'\n553\t    - - item_id (with hardware)\n554\t      - 33.0%\n555\t      - '[25.1%, 41.8%]'\n556\t    - - residual\n557\t      - 18.0%\n558\t      - '[14.2%, 22.5%]'\n559\t  - name: 'Table 9: Separability With vs Without Hardware'\n560\t    columns:\n561\t    - Interaction\n562\t    - Single-GPU (exp-001)\n563\t    - Multi-GPU (exp-003)\n564\t    - Separability\n565\t    rows:\n566\t    - - infra×method (binary)\n567\t      - 1.5%\n568\t      - 5.5%\n569\t      - FAILS (>3%)\n570\t    - - precision×temperature\n571\t      - 1.5%\n572\t      - 1.5%\n573\t      - marginal\n574\t    - - hardware×methodology\n575\t      - N/A\n576\t      - 4.0%\n577\t      - FAILS\n578\t    - - hardware×precision\n579\t      - N/A\n580\t      - 3.5%\n581\t      - FAILS\n582\t  figures_description:\n583\t  - Stacked bar对比exp-001(single GPU)和exp-003(multi-GPU)方差分解。新增hardware-related components（14%）从item_id和residual中'夺取'方差。\n584\t  - 'Heatmap: 200 items × 2 GPUs的accuracy差值，标注decision boundary items的hardware-sensitivity。'\n585\t  analysis: '对Claim 2（separability）致命打击。Hardware crossing不仅没confirm separability反而breaks\n586\t    it——infra×method从1.5%跳到5.5%。\n587\t\n588\t    更深层implication：每增加一个之前被忽略的facet，item_id估计就下降（37.8%→33%），暗示item_id是\"catch-all\"——它吸收所有未建模facet的方差。这与exp-004的model-as-facet发现平行。\n589\t\n590\t    '\n591\t- name: Comprehensive analysis (model-as-facet + bootstrap + D-study)\n592\t  plan_id: exp-004\n593\t  description: 合并exp-001/001b/002/003数据。Model-as-facet reanalysis、bootstrap CIs、D-study\n594\t    projections、REML sensitivity、ranking stability。\n595\t  expected_results:\n596\t    item_id_model_fixed: 0.378\n597\t    item_id_model_crossed: 0.152\n598\t    model_main_effect: 0.06\n599\t    model_x_item_mmlu: 0.33\n600\t    model_x_prompt: 0.02\n601\t    model_x_temperature: 0.015\n602\t    residual_model_crossed: 0.12\n603\t    bootstrap_ci_item_id_fixed: '[0.27, 0.48]'\n604\t    bootstrap_ci_item_id_crossed: '[0.08, 0.23]'\n605\t    bootstrap_ci_model_x_item: '[0.24, 0.42]'\n606\t    bootstrap_ci_width_item_id: 0.21\n607\t    rank_stability_across_bootstraps: 0.68\n608\t    bootstraps_item_id_largest: 0.45\n609\t    bootstraps_model_x_item_largest: 0.38\n610\t    bootstraps_residual_largest: 0.17\n611\t    dstudy_items_g90_mmlu: 480\n612\t    dstudy_items_g90_gsm8k: 420\n613\t    dstudy_items_g90_arc: 450\n614\t    dstudy_items_g90_hellaswag: 440\n615\t    dstudy_cross_benchmark_range: 60\n616\t    dstudy_ci_width_mmlu: 180\n617\t    dstudy_ci_width_gsm8k: 200\n618\t    reml_henderson_divergence_item_id_pp: 5.7\n619\t    model_ranking_flips: 4\n620\t  result_rationale: 'Model-as-facet reanalysis是worst档的核心打击。Model从fixed变为crossed random\n621\t    facet，item_id从37.8%暴跌至15.2%——差值大部分被model×item interaction（33%）吸收。解读：prior work\n622\t    treating model as fixed，系统性地将model-specific item难度差异misattributed to \"item difficulty\"。一个item在Qwen3上easy但Mistral上hard——这不是item\n623\t    difficulty，而是model×item interaction。Model×item=33%意味着item\"难度\"不是items的intrinsic\n624\t    property，而是item-model pair的joint property，从根本上质疑IRT和G-theory中\"item difficulty\n625\t    is a stable attribute\"的假设。\n626\t\n627\t    Bootstrap CIs devastating：item_id (model-fixed) CI=[0.27, 0.48], width=0.21。45%的bootstrap\n628\t    samples中item_id是largest，38%中model×item是largest。Component ranking本身不稳定——无法reliably\n629\t    claim任何single component \"dominates\"。\n630\t\n631\t    D-study projections跨benchmark CONVERGE：G≥0.90需要的items在MMLU(480)、GSM8K(420)、ARC(450)、HellaSwag(440)上差异仅60\n632\t    items。CI宽度（180-200 items）远大于cross-benchmark range，benchmark间差异statistically indistinguishable。这消灭了\"benchmark-specific\n633\t    budgets\"贡献。\n634\t\n635\t    REML vs Henderson Method I在item_id上分歧5.7pp（REML=32.1%, Henderson=37.8%），estimation\n636\t    method choice也是方差来源，支撑meta-methodological argument。\n637\t\n638\t    Model ranking stability：precision×temperature在4个model-pair comparisons中翻转ranking——即使\"small\"\n639\t    interactions也有practical significance for model comparison。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t  tables:\n643\t  - name: 'Table 10: Model-Fixed vs Model-Crossed (MMLU binary)'\n644\t    columns:\n645\t    - Component\n646\t    - Model-Fixed\n647\t    - Model-Crossed\n648\t    - Δ\n649\t    - Interpretation\n650\t    rows:\n651\t    - - item_id\n652\t      - 37.8%\n653\t      - 15.2%\n654\t      - -22.6pp\n655\t      - misattributed to model×item\n656\t    - - model×item\n657\t      - —\n658\t      - 33.0%\n659\t      - +33.0pp\n660\t      - largest single component\n661\t    - - model (main)\n662\t      - —\n663\t      - 6.0%\n664\t      - +6.0pp\n665\t      - between-model differences\n666\t    - - residual\n667\t      - 20.2%\n668\t      - 12.0%\n669\t      - -8.2pp\n670\t      - decomposed into model terms\n671\t    - - temp:item\n672\t      - 5.8%\n673\t      - 4.5%\n674\t      - -1.3pp\n675\t      - slight reallocation\n676\t    - - prompt:item\n677\t      - 5.2%\n678\t      - 4.0%\n679\t      - -1.2pp\n680\t      - slight reallocation\n681\t    - - all other\n682\t      - 31.0%\n683\t      - 25.3%\n684\t      - -5.7pp\n685\t      - redistributed\n686\t  - name: 'Table 11: Bootstrap Ranking Stability (1000 resamples)'\n687\t    columns:\n688\t    - Component\n689\t    - 'Times #1'\n690\t    - 'Times #2'\n691\t    - 'Times #3'\n692\t    - Mean Rank\n693\t    rows:\n694\t    - - item_id (model-fixed)\n695\t      - '450'\n696\t      - '320'\n697\t      - '180'\n698\t      - '1.7'\n699\t    - - model×item\n700\t      - '380'\n701\t      - '350'\n702\t      - '200'\n703\t      - '1.8'\n704\t    - - residual\n705\t      - '170'\n706\t      - '330'\n707\t      - '350'\n708\t      - '2.4'\n709\t  - name: 'Table 12: D-study Items for G≥0.90'\n710\t    columns:\n711\t    - Benchmark\n712\t    - Point Estimate\n713\t    - Bootstrap 95% CI\n714\t    - CI Width\n715\t    rows:\n716\t    - - MMLU\n717\t      - '480'\n718\t      - '[380, 560]'\n719\t      - '180'\n720\t    - - GSM8K\n721\t      - '420'\n722\t      - '[310, 510]'\n723\t      - '200'\n724\t    - - ARC\n725\t      - '450'\n726\t      - '[350, 540]'\n727\t      - '190'\n728\t    - - HellaSwag\n729\t      - '440'\n730\t      - '[340, 530]'\n731\t      - '190'\n732\t    - - Cross-benchmark range\n733\t      - '60'\n734\t      - —\n735\t      - —\n736\t  - name: 'Table 13: REML vs Henderson Method I'\n737\t    columns:\n738\t    - Component\n739\t    - Henderson\n740\t    - REML\n741\t    - Δ\n742\t    rows:\n743\t    - - item_id\n744\t      - 37.8%\n745\t      - 32.1%\n746\t      - -5.7pp\n747\t    - - model×item\n748\t      - 33.0%\n749\t      - 35.2%\n750\t      - +2.2pp\n751\t    - - residual\n752\t      - 20.2%\n753\t      - 22.8%\n754\t      - +2.6pp\n755\t  figures_description:\n756\t  - 'Waterfall chart: model-fixed→model-crossed方差迁移路径，展示item_id 38%→15%和model×item\n757\t    0→33%。Meta-methodological argument核心visual。'\n758\t  - 'Bootstrap density plots: item_id vs model×item vs residual的posterior distributions，extensive\n759\t    overlap——无法distinguish哪个''dominant''。'\n760\t  - D-study projection curves across 4 benchmarks (overlay)，curves几乎完全重叠。标注bootstrap\n761\t    CI bands展示projections的uncertainty和convergence。\n762\t  - 'Sensitivity panel: 同一dataset在不同analysis choices（model fixed/crossed, REML/Henderson,\n763\t    different bootstrap seeds）下的item_id估计，展示estimate对specification的sensitivity。'\n764\t  analysis: '三个Claims全面清算：\n765\t\n766\t    Claim 1：item_id 38%→15%（model-crossed），bootstrap ranking不稳定。\"Item dominance\"是specification\n767\t    artifact。\n768\t\n769\t    Claim 2：separability数据来自exp-001/003，此处model×item的大小说明\"item dominance\"本身不是对separability\n770\t    test的正确framing。\n771\t\n772\t    Claim 3：D-study跨benchmark收敛（range=60 items vs CI width=190 items），消灭benchmark-specific\n773\t    uniqueness。但CIs极宽——budget需要自己的uncertainty quantification，成为新meta-methodological\n774\t    contribution。\n775\t\n776\t    '\n777\t- name: 14B model extension\n778\t  plan_id: exp-005\n779\t  description: Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16。模型规模和architecture对方差结构的影响。\n780\t  expected_results:\n781\t    item_variance_qwen3_14b: 0.32\n782\t    item_variance_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.28\n783\t    residual_qwen3_14b: 0.22\n784\t    residual_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.26\n785\t    model_x_item_with_14b: 0.38\n786\t    model_x_item_increase_vs_8b_only: 0.05\n787\t    temperature_item_deepseek_r1: 0.1\n788\t    seed_item_deepseek_r1: 0.08\n789\t    g_coefficient_pooled_with_14b: 0.28\n790\t    architecture_scale_confounded: true\n791\t  result_rationale: '14B模型的item dominance（Qwen3-14B=32%, DeepSeek-R1=28%）低于8B pooled（37.8%），但scale\n792\t    effect与architecture confounded——DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning-distilled模型，lower\n793\t    item dominance可能来自reasoning chain随机性（temp:item=10%, seed:item=8%远高于8B average）而非scale。\n794\t\n795\t    加入14B后model×item从33%增至38%——8B和14B模型在items上difficulty ranking更不一致（14B solve了很多8B无法solve的items），增加model×item方差。进一步支撑\"item\n796\t    difficulty is a model×item property not an item property\"。\n797\t\n798\t    但n=2个14B模型统计力不足，hardware confound未排除。\n799\t\n800\t    '\n801\t  tables:\n802\t  - name: 'Table 14: 8B vs 14B Variance Structure'\n803\t    columns:\n804\t    - Component\n805\t    - 8B Pooled\n806\t    - Qwen3-14B\n807\t    - DeepSeek-R1-14B\n808\t    - All Crossed\n809\t    rows:\n810\t    - - item_id (model-fixed)\n811\t      - 37.8%\n812\t      - 32.0%\n813\t      - 28.0%\n814\t      - 34.0%\n815\t    - - model×item (crossed)\n816\t      - 33.0%\n817\t      - —\n818\t      - —\n819\t      - 38.0%\n820\t    - - residual\n821\t      - 20.2%\n822\t      - 22.0%\n823\t      - 26.0%\n824\t      - 16.0%\n825\t    - - temp:item\n826\t      - 5.8%\n827\t      - 5.0%\n828\t      - 10.0%\n829\t      - 6.5%\n830\t    - - seed:item\n831\t      - 1.6%\n832\t      - 1.4%\n833\t      - 8.0%\n834\t      - 3.2%\n835\t  figures_description:\n836\t  - Model×item vs included model count趋势线（1→2→4→6 models），monotonic增长——当前估计是lower\n837\t    bound。\n838\t  analysis: '加剧model×item问题而非缓解。DeepSeek-R1的异常方差结构展示architecture对方差分解的质性影响。作为supplementary\n839\t    evidence，一段话足够。\n840\t\n841\t    '\n842\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n843\t  plan_id: exp-006\n844\t  description: RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 lr × 4 shuffles ×\n845\t    3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 runs。\n846\t  expected_results:\n847\t    item_variance_sst2: 0.14\n848\t    item_variance_mnli: 0.11\n849\t    item_variance_rte: 0.19\n850\t    item_variance_copa: 0.07\n851\t    learning_rate_main_avg: 0.168\n852\t    seed_main_avg: 0.09\n853\t    data_shuffle_main_avg: 0.058\n854\t    precision_main_avg: 0.021\n855\t    gpu_main_avg: 0.03\n856\t    lr_seed_interaction_avg: 0.11\n857\t    lr_item_interaction_avg: 0.075\n858\t    residual_avg: 0.2\n859\t    g_coefficient_sst2: 0.52\n860\t    g_coefficient_rte: 0.45\n861\t    g_coefficient_copa: 0.32\n862\t    inference_training_correlation: 0.18\n863\t    cross_task_stable: false\n864\t    item_id_resampling_cv_finetuning: 0.28\n865\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning方差结构与inference fundamentally不同——learning rate dominance（16.8%）取代item\n866\t    dominance。但worst档下fine-tuning也exhibit不稳定性：cross-task structure不consistent（SST-2\n867\t    item=14% vs COPA item=7%），item_id resampling CV=28%（低于inference的33%但仍substantial）。\n868\t\n869\t    Learning rate dominance expected——不同lr通向不同loss landscape basins，每个basin对每个item有不同prediction。lr:seed=11%说明optimization\n870\t    landscape随机性irreducible。GPU main=3%是novel finding——fine-tuning中GPU difference通过gradient\n871\t    accumulation被amplified（thousands of steps中compound），比inference hardware effect更大。\n872\t\n873\t    Inference-training correlation=0.18意味着inference-based reproducibility analysis不能generalize到training。但如果整个variance\n874\t    decomposition methodology的reliability已被质疑（exp-001b/004），fine-tuning results也受同样质疑——这是double-edged的。\n875\t\n876\t    '\n877\t  tables:\n878\t  - name: 'Table 15: Fine-tuning Variance Decomposition'\n879\t    columns:\n880\t    - Component\n881\t    - SST-2\n882\t    - MNLI\n883\t    - RTE\n884\t    - COPA\n885\t    - Average\n886\t    rows:\n887\t    - - learning_rate\n888\t      - 15.0%\n889\t      - 19.0%\n890\t      - 17.0%\n891\t      - 16.0%\n892\t      - 16.8%\n893\t    - - residual\n894\t      - 18.0%\n895\t      - 20.0%\n896\t      - 19.0%\n897\t      - 23.0%\n898\t      - 20.0%\n899\t    - - item_id\n900\t      - 14.0%\n901\t      - 11.0%\n902\t      - 19.0%\n903\t      - 7.0%\n904\t      - 12.8%\n905\t    - - lr:seed\n906\t      - 11.0%\n907\t      - 12.0%\n908\t      - 10.0%\n909\t      - 11.0%\n910\t      - 11.0%\n911\t    - - seed\n912\t      - 9.0%\n913\t      - 8.0%\n914\t      - 10.0%\n915\t      - 9.0%\n916\t      - 9.0%\n917\t    - - lr:item\n918\t      - 8.0%\n919\t      - 7.0%\n920\t      - 6.0%\n921\t      - 9.0%\n922\t      - 7.5%\n923\t    - - data_shuffle\n924\t      - 6.0%\n925\t      - 5.0%\n926\t      - 5.0%\n927\t      - 7.0%\n928\t      - 5.8%\n929\t    - - seed:item\n930\t      - 5.0%\n931\t      - 4.0%\n932\t      - 4.0%\n933\t      - 6.0%\n934\t      - 4.8%\n935\t    - - gpu\n936\t      - 3.0%\n937\t      - 3.0%\n938\t      - 3.0%\n939\t      - 3.0%\n940\t      - 3.0%\n941\t    - - precision\n942\t      - 2.0%\n943\t      - 2.5%\n944\t      - 1.8%\n945\t      - 2.2%\n946\t      - 2.1%\n947\t    - - all other\n948\t      - 9.0%\n949\t      - 8.5%\n950\t      - 5.2%\n951\t      - 6.8%\n952\t      - 7.4%\n953\t  - name: 'Table 16: Inference vs Fine-tuning'\n954\t    columns:\n955\t    - Metric\n956\t    - Value\n957\t    rows:\n958\t    - - Pearson r (variance shares)\n959\t      - '0.18'\n960\t    - - Spearman ρ (component ranks)\n961\t      - '0.22'\n962\t    - - Largest in inference\n963\t      - item_id (37.8%)\n964\t    - - Largest in fine-tuning\n965\t      - learning_rate (16.8%)\n966\t    - - item_id rank shift\n967\t      - 1st → 3rd\n968\t  figures_description:\n969\t  - 'Side-by-side stacked bars: inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning (avg)。颜色编码一致展示completely\n970\t    different hierarchy。'\n971\t  - 'Scatter: component variance share inference (x) vs fine-tuning (y)。Points远离diagonal，r=0.18。'\n972\t  analysis: 'Fine-tuning结果在worst档下ambivalent。Learning rate dominance和inference-training\n973\t    decorrelation是novel。但如果paper的argument是\"variance decomposition is unreliable\"，则fine-tuning也受质疑。\n974\t\n975\t    Viable framing：fine-tuning作为ADDITIONAL EVIDENCE for instability——不同analysis contexts产出qualitatively\n976\t    different results。作为supporting evidence有价值，但不是standalone contribution。\n977\t\n978\t    '\n979\t- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n980\t  plan_id: exp-007\n981\t  description: LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为第4种precision条件on MMLU。\n982\t  expected_results:\n983\t    layercast_accuracy: 0.671\n984\t    layercast_vs_bf16_delta: 0.001\n985\t    variance_reduction_vs_fp16: 0.002\n986\t    precision_component_4level: 0.013\n987\t    precision_item_4level: 0.04\n988\t    practical_significance: negligible\n989\t  result_rationale: 'Confound修复后precision main effect已极小（1.6%），LayerCast额外收益微乎其微。LayerCast\n990\t    accuracy=0.671介于FP16和BF16之间，Δ<0.2pp。在worst档narrative（方差分解本身不可靠）下，precision mitigation\n991\t    targeting一个1.6%的component完全irrelevant——即使完全消除precision variance，其他components的instability仍dominate。\n992\t\n993\t    '\n994\t  tables:\n995\t  - name: 'Table 17: Precision Conditions Including LayerCast'\n996\t    columns:\n997\t    - Condition\n998\t    - Accuracy\n999\t    - Precision Share\n1000\t    - Precision:item Share\n1001\t    rows:\n1002\t    - - FP32\n1003\t      - '0.668'\n1004\t      - —\n1005\t      - —\n1006\t    - - BF16\n1007\t      - '0.672'\n1008\t      - —\n1009\t      - —\n1010\t    - - FP16\n1011\t      - '0.670'\n1012\t      - —\n1013\t      - —\n1014\t    - - LayerCast\n1015\t      - '0.671'\n1016\t      - —\n1017\t      - —\n1018\t    - - 4-level precision\n1019\t      - —\n1020\t      - 1.3%\n1021\t      - 4.0%\n1022\t  figures_description:\n1023\t  - 'Box plot: 4种precision conditions的accuracy分布，几乎完全重叠。'\n1024\t  analysis: 'Null result。一句mention：\"LayerCast addresses <2% of total variance, confirming\n1025\t    precision is not a first-order concern once engine confounds are controlled。\"不值得paper\n1026\t    space。\n1027\t\n1028\t    '\n1029\t- name: MATH benchmark extension\n1030\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1031\t  description: MATH 200 items，测试extreme reasoning task是否延续gradient pattern。\n1032\t  expected_results:\n1033\t    item_variance_math: 0.38\n1034\t    residual_math: 0.24\n1035\t    temperature_item_math: 0.09\n1036\t    seed_item_math: 0.07\n1037\t    temperature_main_math: 0.04\n1038\t    seed_main_math: 0.03\n1039\t    prompt_item_math: 0.04\n1040\t    g_coefficient_math: 0.28\n1041\t    items_needed_g90_math: 520\n1042\t    gradient_with_math: still non-monotonic\n1043\t    gradient_spread_5bench_pp: 9\n1044\t    difficulty_bimodality_index: 0.7\n1045\t    bimodality_item_id_correlation: 0.95\n1046\t  result_rationale: 'MATH item dominance=38%——与MMLU几乎identical，彻底否定gradient。原因：MATH的200-item\n1047\t    sample包含高度bimodal difficulty（Level 1-2: accuracy>80%; Level 4-5: accuracy<10%），extreme\n1048\t    bimodality推高item_id，counteracting CoT randomness的预期effect。\n1049\t\n1050\t    关键insight：item dominance不是task type的function，而是item difficulty distribution shape的function。Bimodal\n1051\t    distributions（无论来源——MMLU的subject heterogeneity还是MATH的difficulty levels）inflate\n1052\t    item_id；unimodal distributions（HellaSwag）suppress它。5-benchmark ordering: GSM8K(42%)>MMLU=MATH(38%)>ARC(36%)>HellaSwag(33%)，spread=9pp，无systematic\n1053\t    pattern。\n1054\t\n1055\t    Bimodality index与item_id的correlation r=0.95是一个strong mechanistic finding——prior\n1056\t    work未identify bimodality作为item variance contribution的predictor。这在worst档下是一个positive\n1057\t    sub-finding。\n1058\t\n1059\t    D-study G≥0.90需要520 items，与其他benchmarks（420-480）comparable，进一步支持convergence。\n1060\t\n1061\t    '\n1062\t  tables:\n1063\t  - name: 'Table 18: Full 5-Benchmark Spectrum'\n1064\t    columns:\n1065\t    - Benchmark\n1066\t    - Type\n1067\t    - item_id\n1068\t    - residual\n1069\t    - temp:item\n1070\t    - seed:item\n1071\t    - G\n1072\t    - Items G≥0.90\n1073\t    rows:\n1074\t    - - MMLU\n1075\t      - Knowledge\n1076\t      - 37.8%\n1077\t      - 20.2%\n1078\t      - 5.8%\n1079\t      - 1.6%\n1080\t      - '0.32'\n1081\t      - '480'\n1082\t    - - GSM8K\n1083\t      - Math\n1084\t      - 42.0%\n1085\t      - 22.0%\n1086\t      - 8.0%\n1087\t      - 6.0%\n1088\t      - '0.30'\n1089\t      - '420'\n1090\t    - - ARC\n1091\t      - Science\n1092\t      - 36.0%\n1093\t      - 20.0%\n1094\t      - 6.0%\n1095\t      - 4.0%\n1096\t      - '0.35'\n1097\t      - '450'\n1098\t    - - HellaSwag\n1099\t      - Commonsense\n1100\t      - 33.0%\n1101\t      - 18.0%\n1102\t      - 7.0%\n1103\t      - 5.0%\n1104\t      - '0.36'\n1105\t      - '440'\n1106\t    - - MATH\n1107\t      - Hard reasoning\n1108\t      - 38.0%\n1109\t      - 24.0%\n1110\t      - 9.0%\n1111\t      - 7.0%\n1112\t      - '0.28'\n1113\t      - '520'\n1114\t  - name: 'Table 19: Difficulty Distribution Predicts Item Dominance'\n1115\t    columns:\n1116\t    - Benchmark\n1117\t    - Difficulty SD\n1118\t    - Bimodality Index\n1119\t    - item_id\n1120\t    rows:\n1121\t    - - GSM8K\n1122\t      - '0.34'\n1123\t      - '0.72'\n1124\t      - 42.0%\n1125\t    - - MATH\n1126\t      - '0.33'\n1127\t      - '0.70'\n1128\t      - 38.0%\n1129\t    - - MMLU\n1130\t      - '0.30'\n1131\t      - '0.65'\n1132\t      - 37.8%\n1133\t    - - ARC\n1134\t      - '0.27'\n1135\t      - '0.52'\n1136\t      - 36.0%\n1137\t    - - HellaSwag\n1138\t      - '0.22'\n1139\t      - '0.38'\n1140\t      - 33.0%\n1141\t    - - r with item_id\n1142\t      - r=0.92\n1143\t      - r=0.95\n1144\t      - —\n1145\t  figures_description:\n1146\t  - 'Scatter: bimodality index (x) vs item_id share (y)，5 benchmarks + regression\n1147\t    line (r=0.95)。Mechanistic explanation for why gradient doesn''t follow task type。'\n1148\t  - '5-benchmark radar chart: 每个benchmark一条线，axes为top-5 components。Lines extensively\n1149\t    overlap，没有clean task-type separation。'\n1150\t  analysis: MATH cements non-gradient finding。但Table 19意外产出positive value：bimodality→item_id的strong\n1151\t    correlation是novel mechanistic insight——item dominance is predictable from difficulty\n1152\t    distribution shape, not from task taxonomy。在worst档下，这是paper可以claim的少数positive\n1153\t    findings之一。\n1154\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5170c10d-5bd8-4681-9e58-19a837bd2547","uuid":"0b729913-3a1a-422c-ae18-81c0ca804c27","timestamp":"2026-05-20T23:46:55.242Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T222113/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心framing从\"cross-benchmark variance gradient\"转向\"方差归因本身不可靠——variance\n  decomposition is a measurement, not a fact\"。\n\n  exp-001b的item重采样不稳定性（CV=33%）成为paper centerpiece。三个Claims全部reframe：\n\n  Claim 1 → \"item dominance估计是sample-unstable的（CV>30%），单次方差分解——包括所有prior work——过度承诺归因确定性\"\n\n  Claim 2 → \"model×item交互（33%）是最大的被忽视项；treating model as fixed系统性误归因方差到item_id；separability在binary\n  scoring下也不完全成立\"\n\n  Claim 3 → \"reproducibility budgets必须包含对budget本身的uncertainty quantification——当前D-study\n  projections跨benchmark收敛（range仅60 items），消灭benchmark-specific budgets贡献，但CI宽度(±190\n  items)说明budget本身需要error bars\"\n\n  Cross-benchmark gradient不成立（spread仅9pp，方向不符合knowledge→reasoning递减预测——GSM8K item_id=42%反而高于MMLU=38%）。\n\n  新hook：\"We set out to build reproducibility budgets for LLM evaluation and discovered\n  that the budget itself is unreliable.\"\n\n  Timeline滑到ACL ARR October以容纳reframing和额外resampling实验。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale precision study (confound-fixed, model-as-fixed)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4\n    orderings × 200 MMLU items, V0 enforce_eager。Model-as-fixed分析产出point estimates；后续exp-004的model-as-facet\n    reanalysis将彻底改变解读。\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 172800\n    total_conditions: 1296\n    item_variance_share_pooled: 0.378\n    item_variance_share_qwen3_8b: 0.422\n    item_variance_share_llama31_8b: 0.358\n    item_variance_share_gemma2_9b: 0.401\n    item_variance_share_mistral_7b: 0.303\n    residual_share_pooled: 0.202\n    precision_main_effect: 0.016\n    precision_item_interaction: 0.045\n    prompt_item_interaction: 0.052\n    temperature_item_interaction: 0.058\n    seed_item_interaction: 0.016\n    ordering_item_interaction: 0.012\n    prompt_main_effect: 0.007\n    temperature_main_effect: 0.01\n    seed_main_effect: 0.003\n    ordering_main_effect: 0.002\n    precision_temperature_binary: 0.015\n    infra_x_method_binary_mmlu: 0.015\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.668\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.672\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.67\n    g_coefficient_correct: 0.32\n    cross_model_item_variance_cv: 0.13\n  result_rationale: 'Confound修复后precision主效应从MVP的夸大水平降至1.6%，三种精度accuracy收敛到66.8-67.2%。Item_id在model-as-fixed分析中仍为最大成分（37.8%\n    pooled），表面上支持Claim 1。但四个模型间item_id的变异（30.3-42.2%，CV=13%）已暗示model×item交互的重要性——Mistral-7B仅30.3%（sliding\n    window attention+不同tokenizer覆盖率改变item-model关系），Qwen3-8B最高42.2%。\n\n    G=0.32反映binary scoring下低reliability：200 items不足以压制item×facet交互。\n\n    关键陷阱：这些point estimates看起来支持item dominance narrative，但exp-001b将显示它们对item selection高度敏感（CV=33%），exp-004将显示model-as-fixed分析系统性膨胀item_id（38%→15%）。此阶段的所有table都是\"misleading\n    precision\"的例证。\n\n    infra×method binary在MMLU上1.5%——高于MVP的<0.5%但尚未breaks separability。200 items（vs\n    MVP的50）包含更多borderline items，precision差异在这些items上翻转binary outcome。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Components (model-as-fixed pooled, MMLU binary)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Qwen3-8B\n    - Llama-3.1-8B\n    - Gemma-2-9B\n    - Mistral-7B\n    - Pooled\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 42.2%\n      - 35.8%\n      - 40.1%\n      - 30.3%\n      - 37.8%\n    - - residual\n      - 17.4%\n      - 21.2%\n      - 18.8%\n      - 26.1%\n      - 20.2%\n    - - temperature:item\n      - 6.3%\n      - 5.9%\n      - 5.2%\n      - 5.8%\n      - 5.8%\n    - - prompt:item\n      - 5.8%\n      - 5.4%\n      - 4.8%\n      - 4.2%\n      - 5.2%\n    - - precision:item\n      - 4.9%\n      - 4.6%\n      - 4.2%\n      - 3.8%\n      - 4.5%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 1.8%\n      - 1.7%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.3%\n      - 1.6%\n    - - ordering:item\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.1%\n      - 0.9%\n      - 1.2%\n    - - precision\n      - 1.8%\n      - 1.7%\n      - 1.5%\n      - 1.3%\n      - 1.6%\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.0%\n      - 0.9%\n      - 0.8%\n      - 1.0%\n    - - prompt\n      - 0.8%\n      - 0.7%\n      - 0.6%\n      - 0.5%\n      - 0.7%\n    - - precision:temperature\n      - 1.6%\n      - 1.5%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.5%\n    - - all other\n      - 14.8%\n      - 19.3%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 23.8%\n      - 18.9%\n  - name: 'Table 2: Accuracy by Precision (post-confound-fix)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - FP32\n    - BF16\n    - FP16\n    - Max Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '0.680'\n      - '0.684'\n      - '0.682'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '0.660'\n      - '0.664'\n      - '0.662'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B\n      - '0.706'\n      - '0.710'\n      - '0.708'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - '0.622'\n      - '0.626'\n      - '0.624'\n      - '0.004'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: MVP(confounded) vs exp-001(fixed) 方差分解对比。item_id从58.4%降至37.8%、precision从~7%降至1.6%，标注confound\n    correction的影响量。'\n  - '4-panel heatmap: 每个model的200 items × conditions accuracy SD，展示item difficulty的model-conditional\n    pattern——Mistral-7B的高-SD items集合与其他三个模型的overlap仅~60%。'\n  analysis: '表面支持item dominance（38% pooled），但这是一个unstable point estimate。Cross-model\n    CV=13%暗示model×item问题。exp-001b和exp-004将分别从resampling stability和model-as-facet两个角度瓦解这个数字。Precision×temperature=1.5%开始动摇separability\n    claim但尚未decisive。\n\n    '\n- name: Item resampling stability test (paper centerpiece)\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: 3组独立stratified MMLU 200-item samples（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama-3.1-8B\n    × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample。测试item\n    dominance的抽样稳定性。\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_sample_seed0: 0.48\n    item_variance_sample_seed7: 0.25\n    item_variance_sample_seed99: 0.41\n    item_variance_mean: 0.38\n    item_variance_sd: 0.12\n    item_resample_cv: 0.33\n    residual_sample_seed0: 0.16\n    residual_sample_seed7: 0.3\n    residual_sample_seed99: 0.19\n    g_coefficient_sample_seed0: 0.28\n    g_coefficient_sample_seed7: 0.38\n    g_coefficient_sample_seed99: 0.31\n    g_coefficient_cv: 0.16\n    variance_component_rank_order_stable: false\n    rank_inversions_across_samples: 3\n    bootstrap_ci_item_id_width: 0.21\n    bootstrap_ci_item_id_lower: 0.27\n    bootstrap_ci_item_id_upper: 0.48\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n  result_rationale: '三组不同的200-item stratified samples产出质性不同的方差分解。CV=33%意味着item dominance\n    point estimate在25-48%间波动。\n\n    Sample seed 7抽到更多中等难度items（difficulty集中在0.4-0.6），这些items的model responses跨conditions更一致，item_id仅25%；sample\n    seed 0抽到更多极难和极易items（bimodal difficulty），这些items天然有高item-level variance，推高item_id至48%。MMLU的57个subjects有非常不同的difficulty\n    distributions——STEM subjects（abstract algebra, college physics）bimodal，humanities\n    subjects更uniform。200-item stratified sampling在subject层面balanced，但subject内部的item\n    selection对方差结构有质性影响。\n\n    更具破坏性的是：方差component的RANK ORDER在三组samples间不稳定。Sample 7中residual（30%）超过item_id（25%）成为最大成分，产生3次rank\n    inversion。\"Item selection is the largest variance source\"取决于碰巧抽到了哪些items——不是stable\n    empirical finding，而是sample-dependent measurement。\n\n    Bootstrap CI=[0.27, 0.48]，width=0.21——足够宽以至于无法区分\"item dominance\"（>40%）和\"item is\n    one of several comparable sources\"（~25%）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Variance Decomposition Across Item Samples (Llama-3.1-8B, MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Sample 0\n    - Sample 7\n    - Sample 99\n    - Mean\n    - SD\n    - CV\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 48.0%\n      - 25.0%\n      - 41.0%\n      - 38.0%\n      - 12.0%\n      - '0.33'\n    - - residual\n      - 16.0%\n      - 30.0%\n      - 19.0%\n      - 21.7%\n      - 7.5%\n      - '0.35'\n    - - temperature:item\n      - 7.2%\n      - 9.8%\n      - 8.1%\n      - 8.4%\n      - 1.3%\n      - '0.16'\n    - - prompt:item\n      - 5.6%\n      - 8.2%\n      - 6.4%\n      - 6.7%\n      - 1.3%\n      - '0.20'\n    - - precision:item\n      - 4.8%\n      - 6.4%\n      - 5.2%\n      - 5.5%\n      - 0.8%\n      - '0.15'\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.0%\n      - 2.4%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.6%\n      - 0.7%\n      - '0.46'\n    - - prompt\n      - 0.6%\n      - 1.8%\n      - 0.9%\n      - 1.1%\n      - 0.6%\n      - '0.58'\n    - - all other\n      - 16.8%\n      - 16.4%\n      - 18.0%\n      - 17.1%\n      - 0.8%\n      - '0.05'\n  - name: 'Table 4: G-coefficient and Rank Stability Across Item Samples'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Sample 0\n    - Sample 7\n    - Sample 99\n    rows:\n    - - G (correct)\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.31'\n    - - Largest component\n      - item_id\n      - residual\n      - item_id\n    - - 2nd largest\n      - residual\n      - item_id\n      - residual\n    - - 3rd largest\n      - temp:item\n      - temp:item\n      - temp:item\n    - - Item difficulty SD\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.27'\n    - - Bimodality index\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.58'\n  figures_description:\n  - 三组samples的stacked bar并排对比——'同一benchmark、同一model、不同items → 质性不同的方差结构'。Paper signature\n    figure。\n  - Item difficulty distribution histograms (3-panel)，展示stratified sampling的subject内item\n    selection如何产生不同difficulty profiles，作为mechanistic explanation。\n  - Bootstrap distribution density plot of item_id variance share，标注三组point estimates和CI\n    [0.27, 0.48]，展示CI覆盖'item dominance'到'item is secondary'的entire range。\n  analysis: 'Worst档paper的核心发现。Prior work（Mesting 2026、Brittlebench 2026、Bouthillier\n    et al. 2021）都报告单次方差分解的point estimates作为\"findings\"，但从未测试resampling stability。CV=33%说明：如果Mesting用不同的200个items，她的43.8%\n    judge dominance数字可能变成30%或55%。\n\n    新narrative：\"方差分解不是fact而是measurement——和所有measurement一样有自己的measurement error。当前文献忽略了这个error，导致过度自信的归因声明。\"\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark replication (no systematic gradient)\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4\n    orderings on GSM8K/ARC-Challenge/HellaSwag各200 items。\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_gsm8k: 0.42\n    item_variance_arc: 0.36\n    item_variance_hellaswag: 0.33\n    item_variance_mmlu_ref: 0.378\n    cross_benchmark_gradient_spread_pp: 9\n    gradient_direction: non-monotonic\n    gradient_follows_prediction: false\n    residual_gsm8k: 0.22\n    residual_arc: 0.2\n    residual_hellaswag: 0.18\n    temperature_item_gsm8k: 0.08\n    temperature_item_arc: 0.06\n    temperature_item_hellaswag: 0.07\n    seed_item_gsm8k: 0.06\n    seed_item_arc: 0.04\n    seed_item_hellaswag: 0.05\n    prompt_item_gsm8k: 0.05\n    prompt_item_arc: 0.07\n    prompt_item_hellaswag: 0.04\n    infra_x_method_binary_gsm8k: 0.045\n    infra_x_method_binary_arc: 0.02\n    infra_x_method_binary_hellaswag: 0.035\n    g_coefficient_gsm8k: 0.3\n    g_coefficient_arc: 0.35\n    g_coefficient_hellaswag: 0.36\n    benchmarks_with_item_as_largest: 3\n    total_records_per_benchmark: 76800\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient不成立。GSM8K的item dominance（42%）反而高于MMLU（37.8%），颠覆\"knowledge→reasoning\n    item dominance递减\"预测。原因：GSM8K的200-item sample中difficulty variance极大——从简单单步算术（accuracy>95%）到复杂多步word\n    problems（accuracy<15%），这个bimodal difficulty distribution推高item_id。在8B-class models上，大量GSM8K\n    items要么trivially easy要么完全超出能力，ceiling/floor效应增加item-level variance。\n\n    HellaSwag item dominance最低（33%），不是因为\"reasoning\"（它是commonsense completion），而是其items的difficulty\n    distribution更uniform（大多数items对8B models难度中等），减少了item-level variance。\n\n    Spread=42%-33%=9pp，在[0,12]内。关键：ordering为GSM8K>MMLU>ARC>HellaSwag，不符合任何simple knowledge-reasoning\n    axis。叠加exp-001b的resampling instability（CV>30%），9pp spread完全在noise range内。\n\n    Separability在binary scoring下breaks on GSM8K（infra×method=4.5%）和HellaSwag（3.5%）。GSM8K因precision差异影响CoT中numerical\n    computation；HellaSwag因completion scoring对token-level probability的precision敏感。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Item Dominance Across Benchmarks (model-as-fixed)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - item_id\n    - residual\n    - temp:item\n    - prompt:item\n    - seed:item\n    - G\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 37.8%\n      - 20.2%\n      - 5.8%\n      - 5.2%\n      - 1.6%\n      - '0.32'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 42.0%\n      - 22.0%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - '0.30'\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 36.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - '0.35'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 33.0%\n      - 18.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - '0.36'\n    - - Spread\n      - 9pp\n      - 4pp\n      - 2pp\n      - 3pp\n      - 4pp\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 6: Separability Test (binary scoring)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - precision×prompt\n    - precision×seed\n    - precision×temp\n    - Total infra×method\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.3%\n      - 0.2%\n      - 1.0%\n      - 1.5%\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.5%\n      - 1.8%\n      - 4.5%\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 0.4%\n      - 0.3%\n      - 1.3%\n      - 2.0%\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.8%\n      - 1.0%\n      - 1.7%\n      - 3.5%\n  - name: 'Table 7: Gradient Prediction vs Observation'\n    columns:\n    - Predicted\n    - Observed\n    - Match\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU > ARC > GSM8K (knowledge→reasoning递减)\n      - GSM8K > MMLU > ARC > HellaSwag\n      - 'No'\n    - - Monotonic decrease with reasoning load\n      - Non-monotonic\n      - 'No'\n    - - Spread > 15pp for meaningful gradient\n      - Spread = 9pp\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-benchmark stacked bar chart，颜色编码一致。GSM8K的item_id bar反而最高，标注predicted gradient\n    direction (箭头) vs actual ordering。\n  - 'Scatter: reasoning load (ordinal) vs item_id variance share。Points不follow预测的negative\n    slope，加exp-001b extrapolation的error bars after which all benchmarks overlap。'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark gradient是original framing的primary contribution，在worst档下完全不成立：(1)\n    direction错误（GSM8K>MMLU），(2) spread太小（9pp），(3) 叠加resampling instability后spread在noise\n    range内。\n\n    但separability breaking提供新material：binary scoring下infra×method不是universally negligible的。\n\n    Reframe：从\"gradient exists\"变为\"gradient doesn''t exist, and that''s the finding\"——variance\n    structure的benchmark variation不follow任何simple predictive axis，variance attribution\n    depends on item difficulty distribution shape而非task taxonomy。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。Hardware×methodology interaction核心测试。\n  expected_results:\n    hardware_main_effect: 0.05\n    hardware_item_interaction: 0.06\n    hardware_precision_interaction: 0.035\n    hardware_methodology_interaction: 0.04\n    hardware_seed_interaction: 0.02\n    hardware_temperature_interaction: 0.015\n    total_hardware_related_variance: 0.14\n    infra_x_method_binary_with_hardware: 0.055\n    separability_holds: false\n    accuracy_gpu1_bf16: 0.672\n    accuracy_gpu2_bf16: 0.668\n    accuracy_delta_cross_hardware: 0.004\n    item_id_with_hardware_facet: 0.33\n    g_coefficient_with_hardware: 0.28\n    total_records: 230400\n  result_rationale: '两种GPU架构在BF16/FP16下产出不同accuracy（Δ=0.4pp），因为不同GPU的tensor core实现、CUDA\n    kernel调度、floating-point rounding behavior不同。Hardware main=5%通过hardware×item（6%）放大：某些items在两块GPU上的correct/incorrect判定不同，这些items的logit\n    margin接近decision boundary，GPU-specific numerical noise翻转outcome。\n\n    Hardware×methodology=4%直接breaks Claim 2：methodology因子的效应是hardware-conditional的——同一prompt在GPU1上增加accuracy\n    2pp，在GPU2上可能降低1pp。Infrastructure和methodology不可分离。\n\n    Hardware×precision=3.5%说明precision choice的影响也是GPU-dependent的——BF16在GPU1上比FP16好，GPU2上可能相反。\n\n    Total hardware-related variance=14%，大于precision-related（~6%），说明hardware是比precision更重要但被忽视的方差来源。Item_id从exp-001的37.8%降至33%——single-GPU\n    design系统性高估item dominance，hardware×item被misattributed to item_id。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware-Related Variance Components (MMLU binary)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Variance Share\n    - 95% Bootstrap CI\n    rows:\n    - - hardware (main)\n      - 5.0%\n      - '[3.2%, 7.1%]'\n    - - hardware:item\n      - 6.0%\n      - '[4.1%, 8.3%]'\n    - - hardware:precision\n      - 3.5%\n      - '[2.0%, 5.2%]'\n    - - hardware:prompt\n      - 1.5%\n      - '[0.8%, 2.4%]'\n    - - hardware:seed\n      - 2.0%\n      - '[1.2%, 3.1%]'\n    - - hardware:temperature\n      - 1.5%\n      - '[0.7%, 2.5%]'\n    - - item_id (with hardware)\n      - 33.0%\n      - '[25.1%, 41.8%]'\n    - - residual\n      - 18.0%\n      - '[14.2%, 22.5%]'\n  - name: 'Table 9: Separability With vs Without Hardware'\n    columns:\n    - Interaction\n    - Single-GPU (exp-001)\n    - Multi-GPU (exp-003)\n    - Separability\n    rows:\n    - - infra×method (binary)\n      - 1.5%\n      - 5.5%\n      - FAILS (>3%)\n    - - precision×temperature\n      - 1.5%\n      - 1.5%\n      - marginal\n    - - hardware×methodology\n      - N/A\n      - 4.0%\n      - FAILS\n    - - hardware×precision\n      - N/A\n      - 3.5%\n      - FAILS\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked bar对比exp-001(single GPU)和exp-003(multi-GPU)方差分解。新增hardware-related components（14%）从item_id和residual中'夺取'方差。\n  - 'Heatmap: 200 items × 2 GPUs的accuracy差值，标注decision boundary items的hardware-sensitivity。'\n  analysis: '对Claim 2（separability）致命打击。Hardware crossing不仅没confirm separability反而breaks\n    it——infra×method从1.5%跳到5.5%。\n\n    更深层implication：每增加一个之前被忽略的facet，item_id估计就下降（37.8%→33%），暗示item_id是\"catch-all\"——它吸收所有未建模facet的方差。这与exp-004的model-as-facet发现平行。\n\n    '\n- name: Comprehensive analysis (model-as-facet + bootstrap + D-study)\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 合并exp-001/001b/002/003数据。Model-as-facet reanalysis、bootstrap CIs、D-study\n    projections、REML sensitivity、ranking stability。\n  expected_results:\n    item_id_model_fixed: 0.378\n    item_id_model_crossed: 0.152\n    model_main_effect: 0.06\n    model_x_item_mmlu: 0.33\n    model_x_prompt: 0.02\n    model_x_temperature: 0.015\n    residual_model_crossed: 0.12\n    bootstrap_ci_item_id_fixed: '[0.27, 0.48]'\n    bootstrap_ci_item_id_crossed: '[0.08, 0.23]'\n    bootstrap_ci_model_x_item: '[0.24, 0.42]'\n    bootstrap_ci_width_item_id: 0.21\n    rank_stability_across_bootstraps: 0.68\n    bootstraps_item_id_largest: 0.45\n    bootstraps_model_x_item_largest: 0.38\n    bootstraps_residual_largest: 0.17\n    dstudy_items_g90_mmlu: 480\n    dstudy_items_g90_gsm8k: 420\n    dstudy_items_g90_arc: 450\n    dstudy_items_g90_hellaswag: 440\n    dstudy_cross_benchmark_range: 60\n    dstudy_ci_width_mmlu: 180\n    dstudy_ci_width_gsm8k: 200\n    reml_henderson_divergence_item_id_pp: 5.7\n    model_ranking_flips: 4\n  result_rationale: 'Model-as-facet reanalysis是worst档的核心打击。Model从fixed变为crossed random\n    facet，item_id从37.8%暴跌至15.2%——差值大部分被model×item interaction（33%）吸收。解读：prior work\n    treating model as fixed，系统性地将model-specific item难度差异misattributed to \"item difficulty\"。一个item在Qwen3上easy但Mistral上hard——这不是item\n    difficulty，而是model×item interaction。Model×item=33%意味着item\"难度\"不是items的intrinsic\n    property，而是item-model pair的joint property，从根本上质疑IRT和G-theory中\"item difficulty\n    is a stable attribute\"的假设。\n\n    Bootstrap CIs devastating：item_id (model-fixed) CI=[0.27, 0.48], width=0.21。45%的bootstrap\n    samples中item_id是largest，38%中model×item是largest。Component ranking本身不稳定——无法reliably\n    claim任何single component \"dominates\"。\n\n    D-study projections跨benchmark CONVERGE：G≥0.90需要的items在MMLU(480)、GSM8K(420)、ARC(450)、HellaSwag(440)上差异仅60\n    items。CI宽度（180-200 items）远大于cross-benchmark range，benchmark间差异statistically indistinguishable。这消灭了\"benchmark-specific\n    budgets\"贡献。\n\n    REML vs Henderson Method I在item_id上分歧5.7pp（REML=32.1%, Henderson=37.8%），estimation\n    method choice也是方差来源，支撑meta-methodological argument。\n\n    Model ranking stability：precision×temperature在4个model-pair comparisons中翻转ranking——即使\"small\"\n    interactions也有practical significance for model comparison。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Model-Fixed vs Model-Crossed (MMLU binary)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Model-Fixed\n    - Model-Crossed\n    - Δ\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 37.8%\n      - 15.2%\n      - -22.6pp\n      - misattributed to model×item\n    - - model×item\n      - —\n      - 33.0%\n      - +33.0pp\n      - largest single component\n    - - model (main)\n      - —\n      - 6.0%\n      - +6.0pp\n      - between-model differences\n    - - residual\n      - 20.2%\n      - 12.0%\n      - -8.2pp\n      - decomposed into model terms\n    - - temp:item\n      - 5.8%\n      - 4.5%\n      - -1.3pp\n      - slight reallocation\n    - - prompt:item\n      - 5.2%\n      - 4.0%\n      - -1.2pp\n      - slight reallocation\n    - - all other\n      - 31.0%\n      - 25.3%\n      - -5.7pp\n      - redistributed\n  - name: 'Table 11: Bootstrap Ranking Stability (1000 resamples)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - 'Times #1'\n    - 'Times #2'\n    - 'Times #3'\n    - Mean Rank\n    rows:\n    - - item_id (model-fixed)\n      - '450'\n      - '320'\n      - '180'\n      - '1.7'\n    - - model×item\n      - '380'\n      - '350'\n      - '200'\n      - '1.8'\n    - - residual\n      - '170'\n      - '330'\n      - '350'\n      - '2.4'\n  - name: 'Table 12: D-study Items for G≥0.90'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Point Estimate\n    - Bootstrap 95% CI\n    - CI Width\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - '480'\n      - '[380, 560]'\n      - '180'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '420'\n      - '[310, 510]'\n      - '200'\n    - - ARC\n      - '450'\n      - '[350, 540]'\n      - '190'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '440'\n      - '[340, 530]'\n      - '190'\n    - - Cross-benchmark range\n      - '60'\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 13: REML vs Henderson Method I'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Henderson\n    - REML\n    - Δ\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 37.8%\n      - 32.1%\n      - -5.7pp\n    - - model×item\n      - 33.0%\n      - 35.2%\n      - +2.2pp\n    - - residual\n      - 20.2%\n      - 22.8%\n      - +2.6pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Waterfall chart: model-fixed→model-crossed方差迁移路径，展示item_id 38%→15%和model×item\n    0→33%。Meta-methodological argument核心visual。'\n  - 'Bootstrap density plots: item_id vs model×item vs residual的posterior distributions，extensive\n    overlap——无法distinguish哪个''dominant''。'\n  - D-study projection curves across 4 benchmarks (overlay)，curves几乎完全重叠。标注bootstrap\n    CI bands展示projections的uncertainty和convergence。\n  - 'Sensitivity panel: 同一dataset在不同analysis choices（model fixed/crossed, REML/Henderson,\n    different bootstrap seeds）下的item_id估计，展示estimate对specification的sensitivity。'\n  analysis: '三个Claims全面清算：\n\n    Claim 1：item_id 38%→15%（model-crossed），bootstrap ranking不稳定。\"Item dominance\"是specification\n    artifact。\n\n    Claim 2：separability数据来自exp-001/003，此处model×item的大小说明\"item dominance\"本身不是对separability\n    test的正确framing。\n\n    Claim 3：D-study跨benchmark收敛（range=60 items vs CI width=190 items），消灭benchmark-specific\n    uniqueness。但CIs极宽——budget需要自己的uncertainty quantification，成为新meta-methodological\n    contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: 14B model extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16。模型规模和architecture对方差结构的影响。\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_qwen3_14b: 0.32\n    item_variance_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.28\n    residual_qwen3_14b: 0.22\n    residual_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.26\n    model_x_item_with_14b: 0.38\n    model_x_item_increase_vs_8b_only: 0.05\n    temperature_item_deepseek_r1: 0.1\n    seed_item_deepseek_r1: 0.08\n    g_coefficient_pooled_with_14b: 0.28\n    architecture_scale_confounded: true\n  result_rationale: '14B模型的item dominance（Qwen3-14B=32%, DeepSeek-R1=28%）低于8B pooled（37.8%），但scale\n    effect与architecture confounded——DeepSeek-R1-Distill是reasoning-distilled模型，lower\n    item dominance可能来自reasoning chain随机性（temp:item=10%, seed:item=8%远高于8B average）而非scale。\n\n    加入14B后model×item从33%增至38%——8B和14B模型在items上difficulty ranking更不一致（14B solve了很多8B无法solve的items），增加model×item方差。进一步支撑\"item\n    difficulty is a model×item property not an item property\"。\n\n    但n=2个14B模型统计力不足，hardware confound未排除。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: 8B vs 14B Variance Structure'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - 8B Pooled\n    - Qwen3-14B\n    - DeepSeek-R1-14B\n    - All Crossed\n    rows:\n    - - item_id (model-fixed)\n      - 37.8%\n      - 32.0%\n      - 28.0%\n      - 34.0%\n    - - model×item (crossed)\n      - 33.0%\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 38.0%\n    - - residual\n      - 20.2%\n      - 22.0%\n      - 26.0%\n      - 16.0%\n    - - temp:item\n      - 5.8%\n      - 5.0%\n      - 10.0%\n      - 6.5%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 1.6%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 3.2%\n  figures_description:\n  - Model×item vs included model count趋势线（1→2→4→6 models），monotonic增长——当前估计是lower\n    bound。\n  analysis: '加剧model×item问题而非缓解。DeepSeek-R1的异常方差结构展示architecture对方差分解的质性影响。作为supplementary\n    evidence，一段话足够。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 lr × 4 shuffles ×\n    3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 runs。\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_sst2: 0.14\n    item_variance_mnli: 0.11\n    item_variance_rte: 0.19\n    item_variance_copa: 0.07\n    learning_rate_main_avg: 0.168\n    seed_main_avg: 0.09\n    data_shuffle_main_avg: 0.058\n    precision_main_avg: 0.021\n    gpu_main_avg: 0.03\n    lr_seed_interaction_avg: 0.11\n    lr_item_interaction_avg: 0.075\n    residual_avg: 0.2\n    g_coefficient_sst2: 0.52\n    g_coefficient_rte: 0.45\n    g_coefficient_copa: 0.32\n    inference_training_correlation: 0.18\n    cross_task_stable: false\n    item_id_resampling_cv_finetuning: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning方差结构与inference fundamentally不同——learning rate dominance（16.8%）取代item\n    dominance。但worst档下fine-tuning也exhibit不稳定性：cross-task structure不consistent（SST-2\n    item=14% vs COPA item=7%），item_id resampling CV=28%（低于inference的33%但仍substantial）。\n\n    Learning rate dominance expected——不同lr通向不同loss landscape basins，每个basin对每个item有不同prediction。lr:seed=11%说明optimization\n    landscape随机性irreducible。GPU main=3%是novel finding——fine-tuning中GPU difference通过gradient\n    accumulation被amplified（thousands of steps中compound），比inference hardware effect更大。\n\n    Inference-training correlation=0.18意味着inference-based reproducibility analysis不能generalize到training。但如果整个variance\n    decomposition methodology的reliability已被质疑（exp-001b/004），fine-tuning results也受同样质疑——这是double-edged的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Fine-tuning Variance Decomposition'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - SST-2\n    - MNLI\n    - RTE\n    - COPA\n    - Average\n    rows:\n    - - learning_rate\n      - 15.0%\n      - 19.0%\n      - 17.0%\n      - 16.0%\n      - 16.8%\n    - - residual\n      - 18.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 19.0%\n      - 23.0%\n      - 20.0%\n    - - item_id\n      - 14.0%\n      - 11.0%\n      - 19.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 12.8%\n    - - lr:seed\n      - 11.0%\n      - 12.0%\n      - 10.0%\n      - 11.0%\n      - 11.0%\n    - - seed\n      - 9.0%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 10.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 9.0%\n    - - lr:item\n      - 8.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 7.5%\n    - - data_shuffle\n      - 6.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 5.8%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 5.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 4.8%\n    - - gpu\n      - 3.0%\n      - 3.0%\n      - 3.0%\n      - 3.0%\n      - 3.0%\n    - - precision\n      - 2.0%\n      - 2.5%\n      - 1.8%\n      - 2.2%\n      - 2.1%\n    - - all other\n      - 9.0%\n      - 8.5%\n      - 5.2%\n      - 6.8%\n      - 7.4%\n  - name: 'Table 16: Inference vs Fine-tuning'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Pearson r (variance shares)\n      - '0.18'\n    - - Spearman ρ (component ranks)\n      - '0.22'\n    - - Largest in inference\n      - item_id (37.8%)\n    - - Largest in fine-tuning\n      - learning_rate (16.8%)\n    - - item_id rank shift\n      - 1st → 3rd\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side stacked bars: inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning (avg)。颜色编码一致展示completely\n    different hierarchy。'\n  - 'Scatter: component variance share inference (x) vs fine-tuning (y)。Points远离diagonal，r=0.18。'\n  analysis: 'Fine-tuning结果在worst档下ambivalent。Learning rate dominance和inference-training\n    decorrelation是novel。但如果paper的argument是\"variance decomposition is unreliable\"，则fine-tuning也受质疑。\n\n    Viable framing：fine-tuning作为ADDITIONAL EVIDENCE for instability——不同analysis contexts产出qualitatively\n    different results。作为supporting evidence有价值，但不是standalone contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为第4种precision条件on MMLU。\n  expected_results:\n    layercast_accuracy: 0.671\n    layercast_vs_bf16_delta: 0.001\n    variance_reduction_vs_fp16: 0.002\n    precision_component_4level: 0.013\n    precision_item_4level: 0.04\n    practical_significance: negligible\n  result_rationale: 'Confound修复后precision main effect已极小（1.6%），LayerCast额外收益微乎其微。LayerCast\n    accuracy=0.671介于FP16和BF16之间，Δ<0.2pp。在worst档narrative（方差分解本身不可靠）下，precision mitigation\n    targeting一个1.6%的component完全irrelevant——即使完全消除precision variance，其他components的instability仍dominate。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 17: Precision Conditions Including LayerCast'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Accuracy\n    - Precision Share\n    - Precision:item Share\n    rows:\n    - - FP32\n      - '0.668'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - BF16\n      - '0.672'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - FP16\n      - '0.670'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - LayerCast\n      - '0.671'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 4-level precision\n      - —\n      - 1.3%\n      - 4.0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot: 4种precision conditions的accuracy分布，几乎完全重叠。'\n  analysis: 'Null result。一句mention：\"LayerCast addresses <2% of total variance, confirming\n    precision is not a first-order concern once engine confounds are controlled。\"不值得paper\n    space。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: MATH 200 items，测试extreme reasoning task是否延续gradient pattern。\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_math: 0.38\n    residual_math: 0.24\n    temperature_item_math: 0.09\n    seed_item_math: 0.07\n    temperature_main_math: 0.04\n    seed_main_math: 0.03\n    prompt_item_math: 0.04\n    g_coefficient_math: 0.28\n    items_needed_g90_math: 520\n    gradient_with_math: still non-monotonic\n    gradient_spread_5bench_pp: 9\n    difficulty_bimodality_index: 0.7\n    bimodality_item_id_correlation: 0.95\n  result_rationale: 'MATH item dominance=38%——与MMLU几乎identical，彻底否定gradient。原因：MATH的200-item\n    sample包含高度bimodal difficulty（Level 1-2: accuracy>80%; Level 4-5: accuracy<10%），extreme\n    bimodality推高item_id，counteracting CoT randomness的预期effect。\n\n    关键insight：item dominance不是task type的function，而是item difficulty distribution shape的function。Bimodal\n    distributions（无论来源——MMLU的subject heterogeneity还是MATH的difficulty levels）inflate\n    item_id；unimodal distributions（HellaSwag）suppress它。5-benchmark ordering: GSM8K(42%)>MMLU=MATH(38%)>ARC(36%)>HellaSwag(33%)，spread=9pp，无systematic\n    pattern。\n\n    Bimodality index与item_id的correlation r=0.95是一个strong mechanistic finding——prior\n    work未identify bimodality作为item variance contribution的predictor。这在worst档下是一个positive\n    sub-finding。\n\n    D-study G≥0.90需要520 items，与其他benchmarks（420-480）comparable，进一步支持convergence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Full 5-Benchmark Spectrum'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Type\n    - item_id\n    - residual\n    - temp:item\n    - seed:item\n    - G\n    - Items G≥0.90\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - Knowledge\n      - 37.8%\n      - 20.2%\n      - 5.8%\n      - 1.6%\n      - '0.32'\n      - '480'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Math\n      - 42.0%\n      - 22.0%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - '0.30'\n      - '420'\n    - - ARC\n      - Science\n      - 36.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - '0.35'\n      - '450'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - Commonsense\n      - 33.0%\n      - 18.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - '0.36'\n      - '440'\n    - - MATH\n      - Hard reasoning\n      - 38.0%\n      - 24.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - '0.28'\n      - '520'\n  - name: 'Table 19: Difficulty Distribution Predicts Item Dominance'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Difficulty SD\n    - Bimodality Index\n    - item_id\n    rows:\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.72'\n      - 42.0%\n    - - MATH\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.70'\n      - 38.0%\n    - - MMLU\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.65'\n      - 37.8%\n    - - ARC\n      - '0.27'\n      - '0.52'\n      - 36.0%\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.38'\n      - 33.0%\n    - - r with item_id\n      - r=0.92\n      - r=0.95\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: bimodality index (x) vs item_id share (y)，5 benchmarks + regression\n    line (r=0.95)。Mechanistic explanation for why gradient doesn''t follow task type。'\n  - '5-benchmark radar chart: 每个benchmark一条线，axes为top-5 components。Lines extensively\n    overlap，没有clean task-type separation。'\n  analysis: MATH cements non-gradient finding。但Table 19意外产出positive value：bimodality→item_id的strong\n    correlation是novel mechanistic insight——item dominance is predictable from difficulty\n    distribution shape, not from task taxonomy。在worst档下，这是paper可以claim的少数positive\n    findings之一。\n","numLines":1154,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1154}}}
